>VpNac
śakyate na vinā tena dinamātro pi jīvituṃ | śakyate tair vināpy arthai rājan_ varttayituṃ ciraṃ |
>VpNpc
śakyate na vinā tena dinamātro pi jīvituṃ | śakyate nnair vināpy arthai rājan_ varttayituṃ ciraṃ | nanv āhārair vvihīne na śakyaṃ varttayituṃ ciraṃ ||
>MbhC
śakyate dustyaje 'py arthe cirarātrāya jīvitum | na tu bhojanam utsṛjya śakyaṃ vartayituṃ ciram || 7
>MbhS
śakyate puṣkalasyārthe cirarātrāya jīvitum | na tu bhojanam utsṛjya śakyaṃ vartayituṃ ciram || 7
>VpBh
āhāraṃ puṣkalaṃ kurvan_ ciraṃ jīvati prāṇabhṛt | na tv āhāravihīno 'pi śaknoti jīvituṃ ciram || 22 ||
>VpBh-A
āhāraṃ puṣkalaṃ kurvan_ ciraṃ jīvati mānabhṛt | na tv āhāravihīno 'pi śaknoti jīvituṃ ciram || 22 ||
>VpBh-B
āhāraṃ duṣkaraṃ kurvan_ ciraṃ jīvati prāṇabhṛt | na tv āhāravihīno 'pi śaknoti jīvituṃ ciram || 22 ||
>VpBh-C
āhāraṃ duṣkaraṃ kurvan_ ciraṃ jīvati prāṇabhṛt | na tv āhāravihīno 'pi śaknoti jīvituṃ ciram || 22 ||
>VpBh-D
āhāraṃ duṣkaraṃ kurvan_ ciraṃ jīvati prāṇabhṛt | na tv āhāravihīno 'pi śaknoti jīvituṃ ciram || 22 ||
